---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Prima Digital — web development studio building on CMS platforms, plugins, and SaaS.">
  <div class="about">
    <p class="lead">I'm John — director at Prima Digital, based in Vancouver. Masters from UBC, undergrad at UofC, spent time at larger web development firms before this.</p>

    <p>Previously a director at WiPro Technologies, who are still a current client. Skis, cycles, runs, swims.</p>

    <p>Prima Digital is a web development studio. We've built on CMS platforms for years and we're expanding into plugins across those platforms — with SaaS products on the roadmap.</p>

    <p>This site is the process log for that last part. Building with AI tools is genuinely different from building client work, and we're working out how to do it properly — the runbooks, the pre-build locks, the failure modes. That's what's here.</p>

    <p>If you're working through similar things or want to talk about the process: <a href="mailto:john@primadigital.net">john@primadigital.net</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .about .lead {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #888;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .about a:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }
</style>
